# CR 613.4d: two switches put power and toughness back where they started.
# Forge counts the "power and toughness are switched" keyword and swaps only
# for an odd count (Card.java:4448), so the Spider (2/4) attacks as a 2/4
# and deals 2. Both spells are cast before either resolves: after one
# resolution alone the 4/2 would be the real state.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
tapformana human 4 R
queue targets 5
castspell human 2
resolvestack
advance 2
queue attackers 5
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
